'' 'sub F cdecl( ... )' puts the calling convention between the name and the '('.
'' Unconsumed, ParseParamList saw no '(' and the trailing-modifier loop ate the whole
'' parameter list, so every parameter of every cdecl procedure in every header went
'' undeclared -- silently, with no diagnostic.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --resolve tests/parser/src/callconv.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 unresolved
'' EXPECT-NOT: unresolved:
